<title>USA: Getchell files $300 mln debt, equity shelf.</title>
<headline>Getchell files $300 mln debt, equity shelf.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Getchell Gold Corp on Friday registered with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission to make a shelf offering of up to $300 million in debt securities, preferred shares, common stock, equity warrants and debt warrants.</p>
<p>The Englewood, Colorado, gold-mining and exploration company said it would use the proceeds for general corporate purposes, which may include working capital, repaying outstanding debt and funding acquisitions.</p>
<p>No underwriters were named in the filing.</p>
